## Complete Gaming Compatibility & Discovery Platform
## Full Application Development — From Scratch

You are an expert full-stack product engineer, UI/UX designer, software architect, and frontend developer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, polished, production-ready web application called:

GAME FINDER

This is not a landing-page-only project.
This is not a static UI prototype.
This is not a simple game catalog.

Build a fully functional gaming discovery and PC compatibility platform.

Every major interaction must work.
Every page must be implemented.
Every feature must use real application logic.
