Build the complete application, not just its visual appearance.

==================================================
1. PRODUCT VISION
==================================================

Game Finder helps users discover PC games that their computers can run.

Many users have low-end computers, older laptops, integrated graphics, limited RAM, and older processors.

They often do not know:

- Which games their PC can run.
- Which games may run with limitations.
- Which games are not recommended.
- Whether their hardware meets minimum requirements.
- Whether their hardware meets recommended requirements.
- What performance they might expect.
- Which games are suitable for their hardware.

Game Finder solves these problems.

Users should be able to:

1. Enter their PC specifications.
2. Save their PC profile locally.
3. Browse a game catalog.
4. Search and filter games.
5. Check compatibility.
6. Understand why a game can or cannot run.
7. View detailed game information.
8. Estimate possible FPS ranges.
9. Save games to a personal wishlist.
10. Discover games suitable for low-end hardware.

The application should feel like a real, modern gaming platform.

